                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h3 class="footer-title">Spread The Word</h3>
                    <p class="spread-word-text">Want to offer your time as a Mental Health Professional,<br>Intern,
                        Campus Ambassador? Or be a donor?</p>
                    <p class="spread-word-text">We are always looking for more hands on deck.</p>

                    <form class="footer-form">
                        <input type="text" class="form-input" placeholder="Name" required>
                        <input type="email" class="form-input" placeholder="Email" required>
                        <input type="tel" class="form-input" placeholder="Phone">

                        <div class="form-action-row">
